{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.poster.avif?t=1772518264\" width=598 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.webm?t=1772518264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.mp4?t=1772518264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/cf0137e155386f56849b76b4e2058b9f.poster.avif?t=1772518264\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/cf0137e155386f56849b76b4e2058b9f.webm?t=1772518264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/cf0137e155386f56849b76b4e2058b9f.mp4?t=1772518264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a character who was looking for a J-O-B and ends up in a run down motel called DineInn in the middle of nowhere. With rumors of people vanishing in the forests next to DineInn and stories of monsters and other scary things happening in the forest, you must remain calm and keep cooking.<br>Restore the DineInn and uncover its secrets! <br> <br><strong><i><u>Game play Mechanics: </u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is mostly a cooking and management sim game with a horror theme and story.  <br>Grow your own produce or buy from the shop. Cook the food and sell for money. Take care of the residents and make everyone happy. All while dangers lurking around the DineInn Forest, waiting for you to make a mistake.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/d5d34618b58da60f438c858a0332ba7e.poster.avif?t=1772518264\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/d5d34618b58da60f438c858a0332ba7e.webm?t=1772518264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/d5d34618b58da60f438c858a0332ba7e.mp4?t=1772518264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/e919d9a9b7dfe0b36e72a4ad30231148.poster.avif?t=1772518264\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/e919d9a9b7dfe0b36e72a4ad30231148.webm?t=1772518264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/e919d9a9b7dfe0b36e72a4ad30231148.mp4?t=1772518264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i><u>The following game play will be Included:</u></i>  <br>- Greet the customers and residents. <br>- Purchase the ingredients from the convenience store. <br>- Grow crops<br>- Raise poultry in your garden<br>- Unlock more recipes for food and drinks.<br>- Cook food for the residents and customers. <br>- Clean the pool, kitchen and garden.<br>- Do the laundry for the motel residents.<br>- Find people willing to work in this motel.<br>- Find notes and Keys hidden secrets and doors in the basement. <br>- Uncover the story about what happened to the previous management of DineInn.<br> <br><strong><i><u>Future plans:</u></i></strong> <br>- Add more horror and monsters <br>- Add small jump-scares (not loud annoying ones)<br>- Make a Cozy and Horror game play mode accessible separately in the main menu. <br>- Expand the map so you will walk to deliver food to campers nearby. <br>- befriend a local cult in the forest and cook &quot;food&quot; for their deity<br>- Restore a Car<br>- Add a vehicle for buying and selling products from far away locations. <br>- Add a Delivery driver for making your delivery runs. <br>- Add a Traveling merchant for bringing rare items on special occasions. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450270?t=1772518264","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/88de3758e32fc110cede61b0b773a09831c1d5d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772518264","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/765b3f2c7ae511bbbabfb5af5ee25af7f15f397c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772518264","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/765b3f2c7ae511bbbabfb5af5ee25af7f15f397c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772518264","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3450620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.poster.avif?t=1772518264\" width=598 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.webm?t=1772518264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947